{"claims":[{"claim":"The bill would permit the board referenced in Tennessee Code Annotated § 49-8-301(a) to produce a copy of the tenure policy.","summary_quote":"allow the board referenced in Tennessee Code Annotated § 49-8-301(a) to produce","verdict":"supported","source_quote":"The board may produce and make available, electronically or in a printed, physical

