 medium, a copy of the tenure policy.","error_type":"none","rationale":"The bill expressly permits making the copy available in either electronic or printed form."},{"claim":"The bill would take effect upon becoming law.","summary_quote":"It would take effect upon becoming law.","verdict":"supported","source_quote":"This act takes effect upon becoming a law, the public welfare requiring it.","error_type":"none","rationale":"The summary accurately states Section 2's effective-date provision."}]}
